hadiths[64]{hadithnumber,text}:
"908","[AI-translation] Mamar bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne ghulam ko aik sa' geehun de kar bheja aur kaha: Usay baich do phir us se jau khareed lo. To ghulam gaya aur aik sa' aur kuch zyada liya. Phir jab wo Mamar ke paas aaya to us ne usay is ki khabar di. To Mamar ne us se kaha: Tum ne aisa kyun kiya? Jao usay wapas karo aur barabar ke siwa na lo, kyunke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue sunta tha: Anaaj anaaj ke badlay barabar barabar ho. Unhon ne kaha: Aur us din hamara khana jau tha. Un se kaha gaya: Beshak wo us jaisa nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak mujhe khauf hai ke wo us se mushabah ho jaye. (Muslim: 5/47). Baab: Anaaj ko qabzay mein lenay se pehle baichnay ki mumaniat. (Mushabahat se murad barabari walon ka hukm pana hai.)"
"909","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs anaaj khareeday to usay na baichay yahan tak ke usay poora wasool kar le. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai ke har cheez usi tarah hai. (Muslim: 5/7)"
"910","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Marwan se kaha: Tum ne soodi baich ko halal kar diya. To Marwan ne kaha: Main ne aisa nahi kiya. To Abu Huraira ne kaha: Tum ne parchon (sukook) ki baich ko halal kar diya jabke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne anaaj ko poora wasool karnay se pehle baichnay se mana farmaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: To Marwan ne logon ko khutba diya aur un ki baich se mana kiya. Sulaiman ne kaha: To main ne pehredaron ko dekha ke wo unhein logon ke haathon se le rahay thay. (Muslim: 5/9). Baab: Jab anaaj andazay se baicha jaye to usay muntaqil karna. (Sikak sakk ki jama hai, jo qarz ki likhi hui parchi hai.)"
"911","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs anaaj khareeday to usay na baichay yahan tak ke usay poora wasool kar le. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ham qafilon se anaaj andazay se khareedtay thay to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein mana farmaya ke ham usay baichein yahan tak ke usay us ki jagah se muntaqil kar lein. (Muslim: 5/8). Baab: Naapay hue anaaj ko andazay se baichna."
"912","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muzabana se mana farmaya, ye ke apne baagh ka phal (dar khat par khushk) khajooron ke​ badlay baichay. (Baaqi tafseel is mukhtasar mein mazkoor nahi; muzabana darakht par lagay phal ko toli hui khajoor se baichna hai.)"
"913","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira aur Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Banu Adi ke bhai Ansari ko bheja aur usay Khaibar par amil banaya, to wo umdah khajoor le kar aaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya Khaibar ki sab khajoor aisi hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak ham aik sa' (umdah khajoor) milay julay (ghatiya) khajoor ke do sa' ke badlay khareedtay hain. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na karo, lekin barabar barabar ho, ya isay baicho aur us ki qeemat se is mein se khareedo, aur wazan (wali cheezon ka) bhi isi tarah hai. (Muslim: 5/47). Baab: Khajoor ke dhair ki baich. (Janaib umdah khajoor ki aik qisam hai; jama mukhtalif qisamon ki mili juli ghatiya khajoor hai; wazan wali soodi cheezon mein bhi kami zyadati jaaiz nahi.)"
"914","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khajoor ke dhair ki baich se mana farmaya jis ki miqdar maloom na ho, muqarrar naap ki khajoor ke badlay. (Muslim: 5/9). Baab: Phal paknay se pehle na baicha jaye. (Subra wo anaaj hai jo baghair naap taul jama kiya gaya ho.)"
"915","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phal ke paknay se pehle baichnay se mana farmaya, ya hamein mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/12)"
"916","[AI-translation] Abul Bakhtari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se khajoor ke darakhton ki baich ke baaray mein poocha to unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khajoor ke darakhton ko baichnay se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us mein se khaya jaye ya khaya ja sakay aur yahan tak ke us ka andaza lagaya jaye. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Andaza kya hai? To un ke paas aik aadmi ne kaha: Yahan tak ke us ka takhmeena lagaya jaye. (Muslim: 5/12). Baab: Phal ke salahiyat zaahir honay se pehle baichnay ki mumaniat. (Murad ye hai ke wo khaye janay ke laiq ho jaye jo salahiyat zaahir honay par hota hai.)"
"917","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khajoor ke darakhton ko surkh ya zard honay se pehle baichnay se mana farmaya, aur baali ko safed honay aur aafat se mehfooz honay se pehle, baichnay walay aur khareednay walay donon ko mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/11). Baab: Muzabana ki baich."
"918","[AI-translation] Bashir bin Yasar, Banu Harisa ke azaad kardah, se riwayat hai ke Rafi bin Khadij aur Sahl bin Abu Hasma ne usay bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muzabana ki baich se mana farmaya siwae ariya walon ke jinkay liye Aap ne rukhsat di. (Muslim)."
"919","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Sabit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ariya mein rukhsat di ke ghar walay usay andazay se khajoor ke badlay lein aur usay taza khajoor khayein. (Muslim: 5/13). Baab: Ariya mein se jitna baichna jaaiz hai us ki miqdar ke baaray mein. (Ariya atiya ke wazan par hai, usay baaqi baagh ke hukm se alag kiya gaya hai.)"
"920","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ariya ki baich mein andazay se rukhsat di paanch wasq se kam mein, ya paanch wasq mein, Dawood ko shak hai, unhon ne kaha: Paanch ya paanch se kam. (Muslim: 5/15). Baab: Phal ki baich mein aafat (ka nuksan baichnay walay par hona). (Wasq saath sa' ka bhaar hota hai.)"
"921","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum apne bhai ko phal baicho phir usay aafat pahunchay to tumharay liye halal nahi ke tum us se kuch lo. Tum apne bhai ka maal naahaq kaisay le saktay ho? (Muslim: 5/29). Baab: Us mein se, aur qarz khwahon ka jo payein le lena. (Jaiha wo aafat hai jo phalon aur maalon ko halak kar de.)"
"922","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein aik aadmi ko us phal mein nuqsan pahuncha jo us ne khareeda tha to us ka qarz bohat ho gaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us par sadqa karo. To logon ne us par sadqa kiya magar wo us ke qarz ki adaiyagi ko na pahuncha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke qarz khwahon se farmaya: Jo payo le lo aur tumharay liye us ke siwa kuch nahi. (Muslim: 5/30). Baab: Jo khajoor ke darakht baichay jin mein phal ho."
"923","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jo shakhs khajoor ke darakht khareeday un ki pewandkari ke baad to un ka phal baichnay walay ka hai siwae is ke ke khareednay wala shart lagaye. (Muslim: 5/17). Baab: Mukhabara aur muhaqala ki baich."
"924","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Abu Unaisa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abul Waleed Makki ne bayan kiya jabke wo Ata bin Abu Rabah ke paas baithay hue thay, Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muhaqala, muzabana, mukhabara se mana farmaya, aur ke khajoor ke darakht khareeday jayein yahan tak ke wo ishqaah ho jayein, aur ishqaah ye hai ke wo surkh ya zard ho jayein ya un mein se kuch khaya jaye. Aur muhaqala ye hai ke khait maloom naap ke anaaj ke badlay baicha jaye, aur muzabana ye hai ke khajoor ke darakht khajoor ke wasqon ke badlay baichay jayein, aur mukhabara teesra ya chautha hissa aur us jaisi (shartein) hain. (Muslim)."
"925","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair aur Sa'id bin Mina se, Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muhaqala, muzabana, muawama aur mukhabara se mana farmaya. Un mein se aik ne kaha: Saalon ki baich hi muawama hai. Aur sunya (namaloom cheez ke istisna) se (mana farmaya), aur ariya mein rukhsat di. (Muslim: 5/18). (Sunya ye hai ke baich ke aqad mein majhool cheez ka istisna kiya jaye.)"
"926","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne saalon ki baich se mana farmaya, aur Ibn Abu Shaiba ki riwayat mein hai ke saalon ke phal ki baich se. (Muslim: 5/20). Baab: Ghulam ko do ghulamon ke badlay baichna. (Asal mein samar-us-sineen tha, Muslim se tasheeh ki gayi.)"
"927","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik ghulam aaya aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se hijrat par bai'at ki jabke Aap ko maloom na tha ke wo ghulam hai. To us ka aaqa usay talab kartay hue aaya. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Usay mujhe baich do. To Aap ne usay do siyah ghulamon ke badlay khareed liya, phir Aap ne us ke baad kisi se bai'at na li yahan tak ke us se poochtay ke kya wo ghulam hai? (Muslim: 5/55). Baab: Musarrat (doodh rok kar dhokay walay janwar) ki baich se mumaniat."
"928","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs doodh roki hui bakri khareeday to usay us mein teen din ka ikhtiyar hai, agar chahay to rakhay aur agar chahay to wapas kar de aur us ke saath aik sa' khajoor wapas karay. (Muslim: 5/6). Baab: Jis ka khana haraam hai us ki baich haraam hona."
"929","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ko khabar pahunchi ke Samura ne sharab baichi to unhon ne kaha: Allah Samura ko halak karay, kya wo nahi janta ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne Yahud par lanat ki, un par charbiyan haraam ki gayeen to unhon ne unhein pighlaya phir baicha. (Muslim: 5/41). Baab: Sharab ki baich haraam hona. (Jamaluha se murad unhein pighlana hai.)"
"930","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Wala Sabai, Misr ke rehnay walon mein se, se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se angoor se nichoray janay walay (ras) ke baaray mein poocha. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aik mard ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sharab ki mashkiza hadiya ki. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tumhein maloom hai ke Allah Taala ne usay haraam kar diya hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To us ne aik insan se sarghoshi ki. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Tum ne us se kya kaha? Us ne kaha: Main ne usay kaha ke usay baich de. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Wo Zaat jis ne us ka peena haraam kiya hai us ne us ka baichna bhi haraam kiya hai. To us mard ne mashkizay ka munh khola aur jo us mein tha baha diya. (Muslim)."
"931","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Fatah (Makka) ke saal, jabke Aap Makka mein thay, farmatay hue suna: Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne sharab, murdaar, khinzeer aur buton ki baich haraam kar di. To kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Murdaar ki charbiyon ke baaray mein kya kehtay hain, beshak un se kashtiyon par lep kiya jata hai, khalon ko chikna kiya jata hai aur log un se chiragh jalatay hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, wo haraam hai. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Allah Yahud ko halak karay, beshak Allah jab un par us ki charbiyan haraam karta to wo unhein pighlatay phir baichtay aur us ki qeemat khatay. (Muslim: 5/41). Baab: Kuttay ki qeemat, zaniya ki ujrat aur kahin ki mithai se mumaniat."
"932","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kuttay ki qeemat, zaniya ki ujrat aur kahin ki mithai (ujrat) se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/35). Baab: Billi ki qeemat se mumaniat."
"933","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se kuttay aur billi ki qeemat ke baaray mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is se jhirka. (Muslim: 5/35). Baab: Hajjam ki kamai khabees hai."
"934","[AI-translation] Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Kuttay ki qeemat khabees hai, zaniya ki ujrat khabees hai aur hajjam ki kamai khabees hai. (Muslim: 5/35). Baab: Hajjam ki ujrat ka mubah hona."
"935","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Banu Bayada ke aik ghulam ne seengi lagayi to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay us ki ujrat di aur us ke aaqa se baat ki to us ne us par muqarrar mahsool mein kami kar di, aur agar wo haraam hota to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usay na detay. (Muslim: 5/39)"
"936","[AI-translation] Humaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se hajjam ki kamai ke baaray mein poocha gaya to unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne seengi lagwai, Abu Taiba ne Aap ko seengi lagayi, to Aap ne us ke liye do sa' anaaj ka hukm diya aur us ke ghar walon se baat ki to unhon ne us par muqarrar mahsool mein kami kar di. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Beshak sab se afzal cheez jis se tum ilaj kartay ho seengi hai, ya wo tumhari dawauon mein se behtareen hai. (Muslim: 5/39). (Kharaj se murad wo maali muqarrar jo us ke ghar walon aur aaqaon ne us par lagaya tha.)"
"937","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Zamanay jahiliyat walay oont ke gosht ko hamila oont ke bachay ke (paida honay tak ki) muddat par baichtay thay, aur habal-ul-habala ye hai ke oontni bachay ko janam de phir jo paida hui wo hamila ho. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein is se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/3). Baab: Mulamasa aur munabaza ki baich se mumaniat. (Murad oont ke gosht ko us muddat tak udhaar qeemat par baichna hai.)"
"938","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein do baichon aur do libason se mana farmaya: Baich mein mulamasa aur munabaza se mana farmaya. Aur mulamasa ye hai ke aadmi raat ya din mein doosray ka kapra apne haath se chhuay aur usay ultay palatay baghair (yehi baich ho), aur munabaza ye hai ke aadmi apna kapra doosray ki taraf phenkay aur doosra us ki taraf apna kapra phenkay aur yehi un ki baich ho baghair dekhay aur baghair razamandi ke. (Muslim: 5/3). Baab: Gharar (dhokay) aur kankari ki baich. (Murad baghair ghaur aur ghaur ke baad razamandi ke hai.)"
"939","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kankari ki baich se mana farmaya aur dhokay ki baich se. (Muslim: 5/3). Baab: Najash se mumaniat. (Murad ye hai ke kankari phenknay par baich lazim ho jaye.)"
"940","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne najash se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/5). Baab: Aik ka doosray bhai ki baich par baich karna; is mein Uqba ki hadees hai jo kitab-un-nikah mein guzar chuki hai. Baab: Samaan ko (bazaar se pehle) ja kar lenay se mumaniat. (Najash fareb aur dhoka hai, yahan murad maal ki qeemat mein baghair raghbat ke izafa karna hai taake doosray ko dhoka de.)"
"941","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Laaye janay walay maal ko (rastay mein) ja kar na lo. Phir jo usay ja kar le aur us se khareeday, phir jab us ka maalik bazaar aaye to usay ikhtiyar hai. (Muslim: 5/5). Baab: Shehri dehati ki taraf se na baichay. (Jalab se murad baichnay ke liye laya gaya maal hai; maalik se murad laye gaye maal ka maalik hai, jab wo bazaar aaye aur qeemat janay to usay wapas lenay ka ikhtiyar hai.)"
"942","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sawaaron se, jo maal le kar aayein, aagay ja kar mulaqat karnay se aur shehri ko bahar se aanay walay ka maal baichnay se mana farmaya. Taus kehtay hain ke main ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha ke shehri ko dehati ki bai se kya matlab hai? Unhon ne kaha ke sheher walay ko nahi chahiye ke bahar se aanay walay ka maal bikwanay mein dalaal banay balke us ko khud baichnay de. (Muslim)."
"943","[AI-translation] Mamar bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo zakheera andozi karay wo gunahgar hai. To Sa'id bin Musayyab se kaha gaya: Beshak tum zakheera andozi kartay ho. To Sa'id ne kaha: Beshak Mamar jo ye hadees bayan kartay thay wo (tail ki) zakheera andozi kartay thay. (Muslim: 5/56). Baab: Baich mein ikhtiyar. (Unhon ne kaha ke wo donon tail ki zakheera andozi kartay thay aur hadees ko zaroorat aur mehengai ke waqt ghalla ki zakheera andozi par mahmool kiya.)"
"944","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab do aadmi baich karein to un mein se har aik ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon aur wo donon ikathay hon, ya un mein se aik doosray ko ikhtiyar de. Phir agar un mein se aik doosray ko ikhtiyar de aur us par baich karein to baich lazim ho gayi, aur agar baich karnay ke baad wo juda ho jayein aur un mein se kisi ne baich na chhori to baich lazim ho gayi. (Muslim: 5/10). Baab: Us mein se, aur baich mein sachai aur wazahat. (Juda honay se murad jismon se juda hona hai.)"
"945","[AI-translation] Hakim bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Baich karnay walay donon ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon. Phir agar wo sach bolein aur wazeh karein to un ki baich mein barkat di jati hai, aur agar wo jhoot bolein aur chupayein to un ki baich ki barkat mita di jati hai. (Muslim: 5/10). Baab: Jo baichon mein dhoka khaye."
"946","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya ke usay baichon mein dhoka diya jata hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis se tum baich karo to kaho: Dhoka nahi. To wo jab baich karta to kehta: Dhoka nahi. (Muslim: 5/11). Baab: Jo dhoka de wo mujh se nahi. (Wo luknat ki wajah se khayaba kehta tha.)"
"947","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) anaaj ke aik dhair ke paas se guzray to Aap ne us mein apna haath daakhil kiya to Aap ki ungliyon ne tari payi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae anaaj walay! Ye kya hai? Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Usay barish lagi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne usay anaaj ke upar na rakha taake log usay dekhein? Jo dhoka de wo mujh se nahi. (Muslim: 1/69). (Subra baghair naap taul jama karda anaaj hai, yahan geehun murad hai; aasmaan se murad barish hai; murad kaamil seerat par na hona hai.)"
"948","[AI-translation] Malik bin Aus bin Hadasaan se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main kehta hua aaya: Kaun dirhamon ka tabadla karay ga? To Talha bin Ubaidullah ne kaha jabke wo Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas thay: Hamein apna sona dikhao phir hamaray paas aao jab hamara khadim aa jaye to ham tumhein tumhari chandi dein. To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! Tum usay us ki chandi do ge ya us ka sona usay wapas karo ge, kyunke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Chandi sonay ke badlay sood hai siwae naqad banqad ke, aur geehun geehun ke badlay sood hai siwae naqad banqad ke, aur jau jau ke badlay sood hai siwae naqad banqad ke, aur khajoor khajoor ke badlay sood hai siwae naqad banqad ke. (Muslim: 5/43). Baab: Sonay ka sonay se, chandi ka chandi se, geehun ka geehun se aur baaqi soodi (cheezon) ka barabar barabar naqad banqad baichna."
"949","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sona sonay se, chandi chandi se, geehun geehun se, jau jau se, khajoor khajoor se, namak namak se, barabar barabar, misl ba misl, naqad banqad ho. Phir jab ye qisamein mukhtalif ho jayein to jaisay chaho baicho jab naqad banqad ho. (Muslim: 5/44). Baab: Sonay ko chandi se udhaar baichnay se mumaniat."
"950","[AI-translation] Abul Minhal se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere aik shareek ne chandi udhaar par mausam ya hajj tak baichi, phir wo mere paas aaya aur mujhe bataya. To main ne kaha: Ye aisa muamla hai jo durust nahi. Us ne kaha: Main ne usay bazaar mein baicha hai aur kisi ne mujh par inkar nahi kiya. To main Bara bin Azib ke paas aaya aur un se poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye jabke ham ye baich kartay thay. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo naqad banqad ho us mein koi haraj nahi, aur jo udhaar ho wo sood hai. Aur Zaid bin Arqam ke paas jao beshak wo mujh se bara tajir hai. To main us ke paas aaya aur us se poocha to us ne usi tarah kaha. (Muslim: 5/45). Baab: Aik deenaar ko do deenaaron se aur aik dirham ko do dirhamon se na baicho."
"951","[AI-translation] Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik deenaar ko do deenaaron se na baicho aur aik dirham ko do dirhamon se na baicho. (Muslim: 5/43). Baab: Haar ki baich jis mein sona aur moti hon sonay ke badlay."
"952","[AI-translation] Fadala bin Ubaid Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas, jabke Aap Khaibar mein thay, aik haar laya gaya jis mein moti aur sona tha, aur wo maal-e-ghaneemat mein se tha aur baicha ja raha tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne haar mein jo sona tha usay alag karnay ka hukm diya to usay alag kar diya gaya, phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Sona sonay se wazan ba wazan ho. (Muslim: 5/46). Baab: Naqad ki baichon mein sood."
"953","[AI-translation] Ata bin Abu Rabah se riwayat hai ke Abu Sa'id Khudri Ibn Abbas se milay aur un se kaha: Bataiye, sarf ke baaray mein jo Aap kehtay hain, kya Aap ne wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai ya Aap ne wo Allah ki kitab mein paya hai? To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main aisa kuch nahi kehta, tum Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mujh se zyada jantay ho aur main usay Allah ki kitab mein bhi nahi janta, lekin mujhe ye hadees Usama bin Zaid ne bayan ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar! Sood udhaar mein hai. (Muslim)."
"954","[AI-translation] Abu Nadra se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar aur Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhum) se sarf ke baaray mein poocha to un donon ne us mein koi haraj na samjha. To main Abu Sa'id Khudri ke paas baitha hua tha ke main ne un se sarf ke baaray mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Jo zyada ho wo sood hai. To main ne un donon ke qaul ki wajah se is ka inkar kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Main tumhein wahi bayan karta hun jo main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna. Aap ke khajoor ke baagh ke nigehban ne Aap ke paas aik sa' umdah khajoor la kar di, jabke Nabi ka khajoor ye (ghatiya) rang tha. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Ye tumharay paas kahan se aaya? Us ne kaha: Main do sa' le kar gaya aur us se ye aik sa' khareed liya, kyunke bazaar mein is ka bhao itna hai aur is ka bhao itna hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tera bura ho, tum ne sood khaya. Jab tum aisa (karna) chaho to apni khajoor kisi samaan ke badlay baicho phir apne samaan se jo khajoor chaho khareedo. Abu Sa'id ne kaha: To khajoor khajoor se sood honay ki zyada haqdar hai ya chandi chandi se? Unhon ne kaha: Phir main us ke baad Ibn Umar ke paas aaya to unhon ne mujhe mana kiya, aur main Ibn Abbas ke paas na aaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe Abu Sahba ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Makka mein Ibn Abbas se is ke baaray mein poocha to unhon ne usay napasand kiya. (Muslim: 5/49). Baab: Sood khanay walay aur khilanay walay par lanat. (Baagh ke nigehban se murad qaiyyim hai; umdah ke muqabil ghatiya khajoor murad hai.)"
"955","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sood khanay walay, khilanay walay, likhnay walay aur us ke do gawahon par lanat ki aur farmaya: Wo (gunah mein) barabar hain. (Muslim: 5/50). Baab: Wazeh halal lena aur shubhat chhorna."
"956","[AI-translation] Numan bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna, aur Numan ne apni do ungliyon se apne kaanon ki taraf ishara kiya: Beshak halal wazeh hai aur beshak haraam wazeh hai, aur un donon ke darmiyan mushtabihat hain jinhein bohat se log nahi jantay. To jo shubhat se bacha us ne apne deen aur apni izzat ko mehfooz kiya, aur jo shubhat mein para wo haraam mein para, jaisay charwaha hima (mamnua charagah) ke gird charata hai qareeb hai ke us mein char le. Khabardar! Beshak har baadshah ki aik hima hoti hai, khabardar! Beshak Allah ki hima Us ki hurmatein hain. Khabardar! Beshak jism mein gosht ka aik tukra hai, jab wo durust ho to sara jism durust hota hai aur jab wo bigar jaye to sara jism bigar jata hai, khabardar! Wo dil hai. (Muslim: 5/50-51). Baab: Jo koi cheez udhaar le aur us se behtar ada karay, aur tum mein se behtar wo hain jo adaiyagi mein behtar hain. (Numan ke isharay se murad sun-nay ke saath poori tehseel hai.)"
"957","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par aik mard ka haq (qarz) tha to us ne Aap se sakhti se taqaza kiya to sahaba ne usay saza denay ka irada kiya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Haq walay ko (taqaza ki) baat karnay ka haq hai. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Usay oont khareed kar de do. Unhon ne kaha: Ham us ke (oont) se behtar ke siwa nahi patay. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wohi khareed kar usay de do, beshak tum mein se behtar wo hain jo adaiyagi mein behtar hain. (Muslim)."
"958","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Baich mein kasrat se qasam khanay se bacho, beshak wo (maal) bikwati hai phir barkat mita deti hai. (Muslim: 5/57)"
"959","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Teen (qisam ke log) hain jin se Allah kalam na karay ga, un ki taraf na dekhay ga, unhein paak na karay ga aur un ke liye dardnak azaab hai: Aik mard jis ke paas jungle mein zaaid pani ho aur wo usay musafir se rokay, aur aik mard jis ne Asr ke baad kisi mard se samaan ki baich ki aur usay Allah ki qasam kha kar kaha ke us ne usay itnay itnay mein liya hai jabke wo us ke khilaf ho, aur aik mard jis ne imam se bai'at ki aur us se sirf duniya ke liye bai'at ki, agar us ne us mein se usay diya to wafa karay aur agar us mein se usay na diya to wafa na karay. (Muslim: 1/72). Baab: Oont ki baich aur us ki sawari ka istisna."
"960","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath ghazwa kiya to Aap mujh se aa milay jabke mere neechay pani bhar nay wala mera oont tha jo thak chuka tha aur mushkil se chalta tha. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tumharay oont ko kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo beemar hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) peechay hatay aur usay daanta aur us ke liye dua ki, to wo musalsal oonton ke aagay un ke saamnay chalta raha. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Apne oont ko kaisa patay ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Behtar hai, usay Aap ki barkat lagi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum usay mujhe baicho ge? To mujhe sharam aayi jabke hamaray paas us ke siwa pani bhar nay wala (oont) na tha. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Haan. To main ne wo Aap ko baich diya is shart par ke Madina pahunch nay tak us ki peeth ka faida mera hai. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne Aap se kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak main dulha hun, to main ne Aap se ijazat maangi to Aap ne mujhe ijazat de di. To main Madina tak logon se aagay nikal gaya yahan tak ke main pahunch gaya to mujhe mere mamun milay aur unhon ne mujh se oont ke baaray mein poocha to main ne unhein bataya jo main ne us mein kiya tha to unhon ne mujhe us mein malamat ki. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se kaha tha jab main ne Aap se ijazat maangi thi: Tum ne kunwari se shaadi ki ya bewah se? To main ne Aap se kaha: Main ne bewah se shaadi ki. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne kunwari se shaadi na ki ke wo tum se khelti aur tum us se kheltay? To main ne Aap se kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mere walid wafaat paa gaye ya shaheed ho gaye aur meri choti behnein hain to main ne napasand kiya ke main un ke paas un jaisi larki byah kar laun jo na unhein adab sikhaye aur na un ki dekh bhaal karay, to main ne bewah se shaadi ki taake wo un ki dekh bhaal karay aur unhein adab sikhaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye to main subah oont le kar Aap ke paas gaya to Aap ne mujhe us ki qeemat di aur wo mujhe wapas kar diya. (Muslim: 5/53). Baab: Qarz mein kami karnay ke baaray mein. (Faqar-uz-zahr se murad us ki peeth ki haddiyon ke jor hain, murad Madina tak sawari ki shart hai.)"
"961","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abu Hadrad se apna qarz taqaza kiya jo un ka us par Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein masjid mein tha, to un donon ki awazein buland ho gayeen yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein suna jabke Aap apne ghar mein thay. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne hujray ka parda utha kar un ki taraf niklay aur farmaya: Ae Ka'b bin Malik! Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main haazir hun. To Aap ne apne haath se ishara kiya ke (aadha qarz) muaf kar do. To Ka'b ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne muaf kar diya. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ibn Abu Hadrad se farmaya: Khaday ho aur us ka qarz ada karo. (Muslim)."
"962","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Maaldaar ka taalne (adaiyagi mein dair karna) zulm hai, aur jab tum mein se kisi ka qarz kisi maal daar par hawala kiya jaye to wo usay qabool karay. (Muslim: 5/34). Baab: Tangdast ko mohlat aur riayat ke baaray mein. (Matl se murad taqat ke bawajood udhaar ki adaiyagi mein taal matol hai; hawala qabool karnay ka hukm hai.)"
"963","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke aik mard mara aur jannat mein dakhil hua to us se kaha gaya: Tum kya amal kartay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Phir ya to us ne zikr kiya ya usay yaad dilaya gaya. To us ne kaha: Beshak main logon se baich karta tha to main tangdast ko mohlat deta tha aur sikkay ya naqad mein riayat karta tha. To usay bakhsh diya gaya. To Abu Mas'ud ne kaha: Aur main ne usay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai. (Muslim: 5/32). (Tajawwuz se murad taqazay mein narmi aur thori kami qabool karna hai.)"
"964","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Qatada se, un ke walid Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne aik qarzdaar ko talash kiya to wo un se chup gaya phir unhon ne usay paa liya. To us ne kaha: Beshak main tangdast hun. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam? Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jisay ye khush karay ke Allah usay qayamat ke din ki sakhtiyon se nijaat de to wo tangdast ko mohlat de ya us se (qarz) kam kar de. (Muslim: 5/33-34). Baab: Jo apna maal muflis ke paas usi soorat mein paye. (Ye qasam ka sawal hai, qasam ki ba chupi hui hai.)"
"965","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi muflis ho jaye aur (baichnay wala) mard us ke paas apna samaan usi soorat mein paye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai. (Muslim: 5/32). Baab: Baich aur rehen. (Doosra mard pehlay se mukhtalif hai.)"
"966","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik Yahudi se muddat par anaaj khareeda aur us ke paas apni lohay ki zirah rehen rakhi. (Muslim: 5/55). (Salf se murad qeemat naqad de kar samaan baad mein lena hai.)"
"967","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye jabke wo phalon mein aik saal aur do saal ke liye salaf kartay thay. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs khajoor mein salaf karay to maloom naap, maloom wazan aur maloom muddat tak salaf karay. (Muslim: 5/55). Baab: Shufa ke baaray mein."
"968","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne har us shirkat mein shufa ka faisla kiya jo taqseem na hui ho ya baagh ho. Us ke liye halal nahi ke baichay yahan tak ke apne shareek ko ittela de. Phir agar wo chahay to le aur agar chahay to chhor de. Phir agar wo baichay aur usay ittela na de to wo (shareek) us ka zyada haqdar hai. (Muslim: 5/57). Baab: Parosi ki deewar mein lakri gaarnay."
"969","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne parosi ko apni deewar mein lakri gaarnay se na rokay. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Huraira kehtay hain: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhein is se munh phirtay hue dekhta hun? Allah ki qasam! Main usay tumharay kandhon ke darmiyan phenkun ga. (Muslim: 5/57). Baab: Jo zameen mein se baalisht bhar zulm se le usay saat zameenon ka tauq pehnaya jaye ga. (Murad mubaligha hai.)"
"970","[AI-translation] Urwa bin Zubair (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Arwa bint Uwais ne Sa'id bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) par daawa kiya ke unhon ne us ki zameen mein se kuch le liya hai, to us ne un se Marwan bin Hakam ke paas muqadma kiya. To Sa'id ne kaha: Kya main us ki zameen mein se kuch leta jabke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai? Us ne kaha: Tum ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kya suna? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jo shakhs zulm se zameen mein se baalisht bhar le usay saat zameenon tak tauq pehnaya jaye ga. To Marwan ne us se kaha: Is ke baad main tum se gawah nahi mangun ga. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar wo jhooti hai to us ki beenai le le aur usay us ki zameen mein maar de. Unhon ne kaha: To wo na mari yahan tak ke us ki beenai chali gayi, phir jabke wo apni zameen mein chal rahi thi ke wo aik garhay mein gir gayi aur mar gayi. (Muslim: 5/58). Baab: Jab rastay mein ikhtilaf ho to us ki chaurai saat haath rakhi jaye."
"971","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum rastay mein ikhtilaf karo to us ki chaurai saat haath rakhi jaye. (Muslim: 5/59)"
